JOLIET OPERATION

% &,

My briefing will be short, time is upon us.

You will take up a position on the Island of Rustina  in
the Clementine archipelago. You must regain two islands
from the enemy situated to the South and South-East.

The Island of Sidonia  shelters a fortress that has stayed
under the control of a handful of regular soldiers of the
Littlestonian army. They have been able to resist up to now,
but without outside help, they won't be able to hold out for
much longer.

Make sure that this fortified town doesn't fall into the
hands of the Katzars.

Your go !

Swallow this message now !